{"declarations":[{"annotations":[],"doc":{"span":{"end_byte":79,"end_column":4,"end_line":5,"start_byte":22,"start_column":1,"start_line":3},"text":"The usage line of the command-line interface."},"generics":[],"kind":"const","name":"frogmouth.cli.COMMAND_LINE_USAGE","public":true,"source_order":0,"span":{"end_byte":151,"end_column":72,"end_line":6,"start_byte":80,"start_column":1,"start_line":6},"type":{"kind":"primitive","name":"str"},"value":{"kind":"string","value":"usage: frogmouth [-h] [-v] [file ...]"}},{"annotations":[],"doc":{"span":{"end_byte":218,"end_column":4,"end_line":10,"start_byte":153,"start_column":1,"start_line":8},"text":"The complete --help text, without a trailing newline."},"generics":[],"kind":"const","name":"frogmouth.cli.COMMAND_LINE_HELP","public":true,"source_order":1,"span":{"end_byte":526,"end_column":308,"end_line":11,"start_byte":219,"start_column":1,"start_line":11},"type":{"kind":"primitive","name":"str"},"value":{"kind":"string","value":"usage: frogmouth [-h] [-v] [file ...]\n\nFrogmouth -- A Markdown viewer for the terminal.\n\npositional arguments:\n  file           The Markdown file to view\n\noptions:\n  -h, --help     show this help message and exit\n  -v, --version  Show version information.\n\nv0.9.1"}},{"annotations":[],"doc":{"span":{"end_byte":786,"end_column":4,"end_line":18,"start_byte":528,"start_column":1,"start_line":13},"text":"What the command line asks for. Browse starts the browser at the joined\npositional arguments, if any; ShowHelp and ShowVersion print text to\nstandard output and exit with status 0; Invalid prints message to standard\nerror and exits with status 2."},"generics":[],"kind":"enum","name":"frogmouth.cli.CommandLine","public":true,"source_order":2,"span":{"end_byte":916,"end_column":1,"end_line":25,"start_byte":787,"start_column":1,"start_line":19},"variants":[{"fields":[{"default":null,"name":"address","source_order":0,"span":{"end_byte":836,"end_column":32,"end_line":20,"start_byte":816,"start_column":12,"start_line":20},"type":{"item":{"kind":"primitive","name":"str"},"kind":"option"}}],"name":"Browse","source_order":0,"span":{"end_byte":837,"end_column":33,"end_line":20,"start_byte":809,"start_column":5,"start_line":20},"symbol":"frogmouth.cli.CommandLine.Browse"},{"fields":[{"default":null,"name":"text","source_order":0,"span":{"end_byte":860,"end_column":23,"end_line":21,"start_byte":851,"start_column":14,"start_line":21},"type":{"kind":"primitive","name":"str"}}],"name":"ShowHelp","source_order":1,"span":{"end_byte":861,"end_column":24,"end_line":21,"start_byte":842,"start_column":5,"start_line":21},"symbol":"frogmouth.cli.CommandLine.ShowHelp"},{"fields":[{"default":null,"name":"text","source_order":0,"span":{"end_byte":887,"end_column":26,"end_line":22,"start_byte":878,"start_column":17,"start_line":22},"type":{"kind":"primitive","name":"str"}}],"name":"ShowVersion","source_order":2,"span":{"end_byte":888,"end_column":27,"end_line":22,"start_byte":866,"start_column":5,"start_line":22},"symbol":"frogmouth.cli.CommandLine.ShowVersion"},{"fields":[{"default":null,"name":"message","source_order":0,"span":{"end_byte":913,"end_column":25,"end_line":23,"start_byte":901,"start_column":13,"start_line":23},"type":{"kind":"primitive","name":"str"}}],"name":"Invalid","source_order":3,"span":{"end_byte":914,"end_column":26,"end_line":23,"start_byte":893,"start_column":5,"start_line":23},"symbol":"frogmouth.cli.CommandLine.Invalid"}]},{"annotations":[],"doc":{"span":{"end_byte":2376,"end_column":8,"end_line":50,"start_byte":1002,"start_column":5,"start_line":26},"text":"Interpret the command-line arguments, program name excluded, like\nupstream Frogmouth's argparse parser with the options -h/--help and\n-v/--version and the positional \"file\" arguments.\n\nEvery argument after the first argument that is exactly \"--\" is\npositional, and that \"--\" itself is dropped. Before it, an argument is an\noption when it starts with \"-\", is longer than one character, contains\nno space and is not a negative number (matching ^-\\d+$ or ^-\\d*\\.\\d+$);\nevery other argument is positional.\n\nThe first option, from left to right, that asks for help or the version\ndecides the result. Help is \"-h\", \"--\" followed by a non-empty prefix of\n\"help\", or a single-dash option whose first letter is \"h\"; it gives\nShowHelp(COMMAND_LINE_HELP). Version is \"-v\", \"--\" followed by a\nnon-empty prefix of \"version\", or a single-dash option whose first letter\nis \"v\"; it gives ShowVersion of \"frogmouth 0.9.1 (Textual vVERSION)\"\nwhere VERSION is textual_version.\n\nOtherwise, when there are other options, the result is Invalid of\nCOMMAND_LINE_USAGE, \"\\n\", \"frogmouth: error: unrecognized arguments: \"\nand those options in order separated by one space. Otherwise it is\nBrowse of the positional arguments joined with single spaces, or Browse\nof Nothing when there are none."},"generics":[],"kind":"function","name":"frogmouth.cli.parse_command_line","public":true,"source_order":3,"span":{"end_byte":2955,"end_column":1,"end_line":61,"start_byte":916,"start_column":1,"start_line":25},"callable_kind":"sync","parameters":[{"default":null,"kind":"positional","name":"arguments","source_order":0,"span":{"end_byte":958,"end_column":43,"end_line":25,"start_byte":938,"start_column":23,"start_line":25},"type":{"item":{"kind":"primitive","name":"str"},"kind":"list"}},{"default":null,"kind":"positional","name":"textual_version","source_order":1,"span":{"end_byte":980,"end_column":65,"end_line":25,"start_byte":960,"start_column":45,"start_line":25},"type":{"kind":"primitive","name":"str"}}],"return_type":{"args":[],"kind":"named","name":"frogmouth.cli.CommandLine"},"contract":{"clauses":[{"clause_id":1,"kind":"ensures","expression":{"kind":"comparison_chain","operands":[{"kind":"binding_ref","symbol":"frogmouth.cli.text","reference":{"kind":"binding","symbol":"frogmouth.cli.text"},"span":{"end_byte":2424,"end_column":47,"end_line":52,"start_b